{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>לקוט</b> לקוט. Two times in the Masorah: here and \"ואירך ללקוט בשדה אחר\" (and he would glean in another field). Just as there we learn two is לקט (gleaning), three is not לקט, so too here: they gleaned two on the sixth day and found, and on the seventh day they went out to glean the third and did not find."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:13.609221313Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}